# Copy to .env.local and paste a token from https://ion.cesium.com/tokens
#
# This is inlined into the built bundle by Vite and is therefore PUBLIC — any
# browser that loads the app can read it. That is inherent to a browser-side ion
# client; .env does not make it secret. Scope the token in the ion dashboard to
# only the assets this app uses, and to allowed URLs.
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
